        <description><![CDATA[Azure OpenAI Model Routing and Distribution Framework (AMRDF)

The Azure OpenAI Model Routing and Distribution Framework is a high-availability infrastructure solution that intelligently distributes AI workloads across multiple Azure regions. This architecture leverages API Management to route requests to appropriate OpenAI models based on deployment IDs, while implementing circuit breakers and load balancing for resilience. With comprehensive monitoring through Application Insights and Log Analytics, AMRDF provides a robust platform for deploying AI services that can scale efficiently while maintaining optimal performance and fault tolerance.]]></description>
